From 49181b3c081d8fc8d5671c9c4cccd3b67c08a722 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agnimon <agnimon.codex1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:45:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Capture bounded BX observations with explicit
 desynchronization

Expose one synchronous BX capture with complete original bytes, CRC and status evidence. Bound shared serial reads and writes with deadlines; latch timeout/partial-reply desynchronization so a late reply is not accepted as a fresh request. Keep transaction association explicitly unverified.
